--- !u!114 &182868805
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 182868802}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e09bf76285198764994b39f9c09f5f62, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TutorialChefScript
  interactKeyCode: 0
  teleportSceneName: MainGameFIXED
  slowTyper: {fileID: 1475323315}
  dialogueLines:
  - Buongiorno! You must be the new intern chef?
  - 'Anyways welcome to singapore, hot right? '
  - Well let me show you around. This is where you'll be training.
  - Follow me
  currentIndex: -1
  explainationLines:
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueLine: Well here it is! Let me give you a tour of your new home!
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 9bd6fdfc872987a439b0bf30bc2ca7ea, type: 3}
    dialogueLine: This is the recipe book. You can right click on it to open it and
      in there you can find all the recipes!
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1883d127b16fab541a1613a6ac1a2505, type: 3}
    dialogueLine: This is the chopping board. Right click to place food and then
      press E to Chop!
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a187682ef06506e47a3c215476b8aa56, type: 3}
    dialogueLine: This is meat skewer. Press E to flip meats! (Make sure not to burn
      it)
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 415343116336e444fbaf789e9c1769f4, type: 3}
    dialogueLine: This is the laptop and the trashcan.
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 415343116336e444fbaf789e9c1769f4, type: 3}
    dialogueLine: 'Right click on the laptop to open up the shop where you can buy
      more food! '
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 415343116336e444fbaf789e9c1769f4, type: 3}
    dialogueLine: Right click on the trashcan while holding food to throw it away!
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4b4e732469d704545b3b03c221ed2167, type: 3}
    dialogueLine: This is the frying pan. Right click to place food and E to change
      the temperature of it!
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cbcb6dc586db7f94292591ba168610b9, type: 3}
    dialogueLine: 'At the back is the cold storage room. This is where we keep all
      our foods. You can right the boxes to access the foods inside and store them
      back! '
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: cbcb6dc586db7f94292591ba168610b9, type: 3}
    dialogueLine: But uhh.. Make sure not to leave food on the floor. Otherwise rats
      may spawn!
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2453ad5309e5ad745aaab1baa8765bb0, type: 3}
    dialogueLine: Lastly is our state of the art vending machine. Pick a meal and
      input the correct foods and it will dispense your desired meal!
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2453ad5309e5ad745aaab1baa8765bb0, type: 3}
    dialogueLine: How does it work? I don't know!
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueLine: That concludes the tour.
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueLine: But it doesn't conclude your training!
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueLine: I want you to serve 1 customer.
  - backgroundImage: {fileID: 0}
    dialogueLine: Good Luck!
  currentExlainIndex: -1
  nameOfChef: Chef Totori Al
  goingToStall: 0
  startTalkFinish: 0
  reachedStall: 0
  doingServingQuest: 0
  movePoints:
  - {fileID: 1769438510}
  - {fileID: 396561089}
